{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/9a9fa7a22d0e8764b2fd0cbb61f1c999.jpeg",
  "description": "<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\"><b><u>OUR MISSION</u></b></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\">We enjoy taking a holistic approach to life, which is why we carry products that will help you and whatever goal you may have. The past few years have taken a toll on a lot of us and has affected us in many ways. While our founder was on a spirituality journey and working on their own mental health, Highly Mystical Creations was created.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Our shop is based around mental health awareness &amp; spirituality discoveries.</strong>&nbsp;We want to create a safe space for all to feel welcomed without any judgement &amp; where all beliefs for the highest good are honored.</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\">Our mission as a company is to create a more positive and better world.&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">We plant a tree for every order placed</strong>, we believe giving back to the world as much as possible.&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Our company strives to have the best ethics. We are an eco-friendly, substantiable, fair trade, USA artisan supporting, LGBTQ+ friendly, customer focused based company. We believe in equality for all, spreading positivity, and uplifting others.</strong>&nbsp;We are all in this crazy journey called life together!</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\">We encourage you to begin your journey with us at Highly Mystical Creations!&nbsp;</p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-bottom: 0px; caret-color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); color: rgba(221, 187, 119, 0.75); font-family: Kalam, sans-serif; font-size: 17.600000381469727px; letter-spacing: 0.6600000262260437px; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Thank you for supporting a small business!</strong></p>",
